# DriftSense Pilot: a two-person, two-Claude-Code Git plan (Oct 11–26, 2026)

**Use trunk-based development. `main` is the only long-lived branch. Each person works on short-lived branches named by phase (`a/p2-…`, `b/p4-…`) that last one to two days. Every change reaches `main` through a squash-merged PR that the other person approves and that passes CI on both amd64 and arm64. The plan holds together because of three things:** (1) Person A commits a frozen interface contract and a fake engine first, so Person B never waits on A. (2) A committed hook in `.claude/` stops either Claude Code from editing the other person's directories or touching shared files outside a `shared/*` branch. (3) A fresh Claude Code session that has never seen the work verifies the final build from a clean clone before the `submission` tag goes on.

## TL;DR
- **Branching:** one protected `main` (ruleset: PR required, 1 approval, squash-only, linear history, required checks `test (ubuntu-24.04)`, `test (ubuntu-24.04-arm)`, `contracts`, `lint`). Branches live 1–2 days: `a/pN-topic`, `b/pN-topic`, `shared/topic` for shared files, `int/gN-topic` for integration, `fix/topic` after freeze. Gate tags: `v1-munichtech` → `g2-pass` → `v2-freeze` (Oct 19 12:00) → `numbers-lock` (Oct 23) → `rc1` (Oct 25) → `submission` (Oct 26 ~20:00 IST).
- **Decoupling:** on Oct 11, Person A merges `driftsense/contracts.py`, the `driftsense.api.localize()` facade, a deterministic `fake` engine, a `v1` adapter, JSON Schemas and contract tests. Person B builds the service, infra, UI, bench and docs pipeline against `DRIFTSENSE_ENGINE=fake|v1`. On Oct 16–17 (G2), one config line switches B's stack to v2.
- **Process:** both machines get identical Claude Code behaviour from committed `CLAUDE.md`, `.claude/settings.json`, hooks and slash commands (`/sync`, `/open-pr`, `/review-pr`, `/gate-check`, `/handoff`, `/resolve-conflict`, `/tag-gate`). Personal identity lives in the gitignored `CLAUDE.local.md` plus `git config driftsense.owner A|B`. Each person reviews the other's area on Oct 25. An independent verifier session does the judge dry run on Oct 26 before you submit at 21:00 IST.

